    "body": "~~Our Lord Jesus Christ said to~~ map `-` to navigate to parent directory in directory edit buffers here: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39723#issuecomment-4804095389\r\n\r\nNote: the mapping here is GLOBAL.",
